      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Audio recordings of twenty minutes or more are suggested like video ones (for a campus that records audio only). Each Mac keeps its own project, so a campus&#39;s Mac publishes to its own folder.</li><li>Settings ▸ Sources: add folders or network shares to look through, and pair a HyperDeck recorder (found by itself, or by address). A recording on the recorder is copied to this Mac when you open it.</li><li>On your drives: "All files" lists everything else the app can open, such as a short midweek class.</li></ul>]]></description>
